  <p id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0000" ref="6y2_apj_l05">順</persName><persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0001" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABAAA">謝皇后</persName>諱<persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0005" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABAAA">梵境</persName>，陳郡陽夏人。右光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0019" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABA">莊</persName>之孫也。父<persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0025" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABAA">揚</persName>，車騎功曹。升明二年，立為皇后。<persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0042" ref="6y2_apj_l05">順帝</persName>禪位，降為汝陰王妃。祖<persName id="c-nanshi-011-xiefanjing:p001:m0055" ref="aa6_83c_juy_DBABA">莊</persName>自有傳。</p>
</text>
